Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: remoteproc: document multipd auxiliary images

The Q6 MPD loader accepts an array of three firmware-name entries:
one root image followed by up to two auxiliary MDT images loaded
into WCSS memory before the processor starts. Allow all three
entries in the binding.

---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,multipd-pil.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,multipd-pil.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,multipd-pil.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,multipd-pil.yaml
@@ -26,7 +26,11 @@
     maxItems: 1
 
   firmware-name:
-    maxItems: 2
+    description: |
+      The root Q6 image followed by up to two auxiliary images to load
+      into its reserved memory before the remote processor starts.
+      IPQ5332 uses separate IU firmware images for its UserPD radios.
+    maxItems: 3
 
   boot-args:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32-array
